<title>CHINA: China's Jan-Oct coal imports soar by 152 pct.</title>
<headline>China's Jan-Oct coal imports soar by 152 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's coal imports  soared 152.0 percent in the first 10 months of 1996 to 2.69 million tonnes, up from 1.07 million tonnes in the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Imports in October alone totalled 210,000 tonnes, the figures showed.</p>
<p>China's coal exports totalled 23.33 million tonnes in the first 10 months, up 3.9 percent from 22.44 million tonnes in the year-ago period, the figures showed.</p>
<p>Exports in October were 3.17 million tonnes.</p>
</text>
